@startuml
title Behavioral 领域用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "求职者" as User
actor "策展题库" as Curated
actor "AI Provider\n（可选，默认禁用）" as AI
actor "Action 域" as Action

rectangle "Behavioral 领域" {
  usecase "UC-BHV-001\n浏览策展题并\n管理自定义题" as UC1
  usecase "UC-BHV-002\n建立并复用\nSTAR Evidence" as UC2
  usecase "UC-BHV-003\n编写并保存\n答案文本版本" as UC3
  usecase "UC-BHV-004\n获取完整性与\n具体性反馈" as UC4
  usecase "UC-BHV-005\n决定建议并\n创建修订版本" as UC5
  usecase "UC-BHV-006\n管理 AI 同意与\n可追溯调用" as UC6
  usecase "UC-BHV-007\n预览并手动删除\n敏感对象" as UC7
  usecase "检查 STAR 完整性" as Star
  usecase "检查证据具体性" as Specificity
  usecase "记录 provider/model/输入/\n提示/成本/输出与缓存" as Trace
  usecase "生成未完成练习 Action" as MakeAction
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4
User --> UC5
User --> UC6
User --> UC7
Curated --> UC1
AI --> UC6
Action --> MakeAction

UC3 ..> UC2 : <<extend>>\n新建 Evidence 时
UC3 ..> MakeAction : <<extend>>\n练习未完成时
UC4 ..> Star : <<include>>
UC4 ..> Specificity : <<include>>
UC4 ..> UC6 : <<extend>>\n使用外部 AI 时
UC5 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> Trace : <<include>>

note bottom of UC4
逐项引用答案片段；
不输出成功概率
end note

note bottom of UC3
v1 仅文本；
无录音和语音分析
end note

note bottom of UC7
级联硬删除内容；
仅保留无内容审计事件
end note
@enduml
